From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Charlie <5764343+charlielye@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 20:15:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] refactor(stdlib): derive contract classes and the genesis
 nullifiers in barretenberg

getContractClassFromArtifact hands the artifact, in the shape nargo writes it, to
barretenberg's AztecContractClass (through bb.js) instead of deriving the artifact hash,
the private functions' vk hashes, the private functions root and the class id in TS.
The protocol contract genesis nullifiers come from AztecProtocolGenesisNullifiers.

artifact_hash.ts and its json-stringify-deterministic dependency go. Deriving a class id
from a class preimage (a class read from chain) stays in TS, as does the PXE's private
functions tree, which needs membership witnesses.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015HXzMEGRnmFYs5yXRcAWCb

